<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Kilimanjaro half yr shr, div rises.</title>
<headline>Kilimanjaro half yr shr, div rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     13.7	  vs 11.7</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 1.9	   vs 1.7</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   3.86	  vs 3.28</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   5.97	  vs 5.20</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.12	  vs 1.92</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.42	  vs 0.62</p>
<p>    Turnover		  40.06	 vs 36.77</p>
<p>Div payable April 25</p>
<p>on register April 11</p>
<p>Full name: Kilimanjaro Investments Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said the results for the second six months should equal those for 1996 signalling an improvement in earnings per share. They said that the sound financial position would permit the firm to make investmetns in appropriate carbonated soft drink and allied industries.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
